Third-party notices and provenance
==================================

This project is a Rust reimplementation of the calculation engine from
SpringSharp, a Windows warship-design simulator.  The Rust code in `src/` was
written by re-implementing the behaviour of the decompiled C# sources kept in
`raw/SpringSharpMono/` (not committed to this repository's history as part of
the crate build, but present in the working tree).

Upstream copyright (from `raw/SpringSharpMono/AboutForm` and
`raw/SpringSharpMono/AssemblyInfo.cs`):

