The upstream SpringSharp source is therefore **proprietary/all-rights-reserved**
rather than an OSI-approved open-source licence.  The Rust port is an
independent reimplementation of the published engineering formulas, but it is
also explicitly derived from reading the upstream source; it is not clear that
this repository has a right to relicense that derived work under MIT.

